{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>Are you not</b> These are the words of the prophet speaking on behalf of Israel, who are in the generation of Nebuchadnezzar. Because he has mentioned His power to his god, he said: Are You not pre-eminent from the day Israel came into being? You were his Elohim and You are my Holy One, not another god. We ask that we not die by the hand of this cruel one, for we know that You, who appointed him to execute judgment upon wicked men, are the Rock who appointed him to chastise. The meaning is doubled."], :book :habakkuk, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["<b>Ibn Ezra on Habakkuk</b>- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/havakuk"] ["Ibn Ezra on Habakkuk -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/havakuk"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:49:07.839779556Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}